# A missing /data, /fonts or /img asset falls back to the app shell (200 HTML)
# via Cloudflare's SPA not-found handling — a JSON/font fetch then receives HTML.
# Cloudflare Pages rejects `404` as a _redirects status (see build warning
# "Parsed 0 valid redirect rules"), so this can't be forced to a real 404 here.
# The service worker instead refuses to cache the HTML shell on those routes
# (see src/sw/service-worker.ts), which is what turned the one-off parse error
# into a persistent one.

# SPA fallback: every unmatched path serves the app shell (client-side router).
/android https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.murajah.webview 302
/*    /index.html    200
